sentences.text:
The petitioner is directed to be enlarged on bail, arising out of Crime No.94/2024 of Lingasugur Police Station, Raichur for offences punishable under Section 363 and 376 of IPC and Sections 4 and 6 of Protection of Children from Sexual Offences Act pending before the Court of Principal Civil Judge and JMFC, NC: 2024:KHC-K:4897 Lingasugur, Raichur District subject to the following conditions:
a) The petitioner shall execute personal bond for a sum of `1,00,000/- with two sureties for the likesum, to the satisfaction of the jurisdictional Court;
b) The petitioner shall appear regularly on all the dates of hearing before the Trial Court unless the Trial Court exempts his appearance for valid reasons;
c) The petitioner shall not directly or indirectly threaten or tamper with the prosecution witnesses;
d) The petitioner shall not involve in similar offences in future.
Sd/-
JUDGE SN Yallappa vs The State Of Karnataka And Anr on 12 July, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/102123877/
